' apps/native/src/app/home.ts (APL-HOME-01): a transient failure (offline, unreachable, a timeout,
' a busy server) is tried again on its own, quickly first, then every fifteen seconds; during the
' quick retries the screen keeps what it shows.

function RetryIsTransient(category as string) as boolean
    return category = "offline" or category = "unreachable" or category = "timeout" or category = "busy"
end function

' The wait before attempt `attempt + 1`, in seconds, and whether it is one of the quick ones.
function RetryPlan(attempt as integer) as object
    quick = [1, 3, 8]
    if attempt < quick.count() then return { seconds: quick[attempt], quick: true }
    return { seconds: 15, quick: false }
end function

' How stale a root's document may be when the viewer returns to it before it is read again
' (screens/Home.tsx `usePullToRefresh(refresh, {staleMs: 10_000})`).
function HomeStaleSeconds() as integer
    return 10
end function
